# Layout ladder, step 6c (plan/20-core-domain/29-layout-ladder.md): the cooling loop as a consumer --
# the same ring with a load on it and a 60 C supply, so the unsourced ring rule (C18) draws it: the
# valve takes the bottom-left corner and the two boundaries stand in a column on the left (C-105).

fluidscript 1
circuit coolingLoop
fluid water

HE1 heat_exchanger power=-30 in.t=50 out.t=30
3WV three_way_valve
PU1 pump

connections
N1 - N2
N2 - PU1
PU1 - HE1
HE1 - 3WV
3WV.b - N2
3WV.a - N3 length=25 dn=25

N1 inlet t=60 p=300
N3 outlet p=280
